     "ref": "Tutorial Terms",
     "question": "Explain: Adjusting Entry, Depreciation Expense, Accumulated Depreciation, Unearned Revenue, Prepaid Expense, Accrued Expenses, Accrued Revenue.",
     "solution": "<strong>Adjusting Entry</strong>：期末为使收入、费用记入正确期间而做的分录，不涉及现金。\n<strong>Depreciation Expense</strong>：本期分摊的非流动资产成本，是费用。\n<strong>Accumulated Depreciation</strong>：累计折旧，资产的抵减账户（contra asset），贷方余额，在资产负债表上从资产原值中扣除。\n<strong>Unearned Revenue</strong>：预收收入，已收款、尚未提供商品或服务，是流动负债。\n<strong>Prepaid Expense</strong>：预付费用，已付款、尚未受益，是流动资产。\n<strong>Accrued Expenses</strong>：应计费用，已发生、未付款也未入账，期末记费用和应付。\n<strong>Accrued Revenue</strong>：应计收入，已赚到、未收款也未入账，期末记应收和收入。",
     "numeric": false
    }
